          "title_zh": "RAG-NAROK：具备来源特定反驳的检索感知型 RAG 知识库投毒",
          "url": "http://arxiv.org/abs/2609.25469v1",
          "source": "arXiv",
          "section": "arxiv_other",
          "organization": "",
          "language": "en",
          "arxiv_id": "2609.25469",
          "summary": "The paper introduces RAG-NAROK, an adaptive knowledge-base poisoning framework that exploits RAG pipeline transparency to first extract the legitimate source identities retrieved for a query, then generates Anchor-Specific Refutation documents that explicitly name and devalue those sources while using recency and authority biases to steer generation toward a target answer. It reports that the attack significantly outperforms static poisoning baselines across diverse domains.",
