          "arxiv_id": "2609.25474",
          "summary": "The paper restructures KYC onboarding from a four-party to a two-party workflow to remove handoffs, then introduces Spectra, a platform that combines a rules engine encoding compliance policy as a queryable database with LLM-based classification, extraction, and validation agents decomposed into isolated, auditable stages. On real KYC documents it reports 100% classification accuracy, 89.4% extraction accuracy, and a 96% reduction in human review burden.",
